  "bio": "Massao Tattoo is a highly skilled artist specializing in black and gray, Japanese, and floral styles. Renowned for their clean and precise handiwork, Massao excels in traditional 手彫り (tebori, or hand-carved) and 和彫り (wabori, or Japanese-style tattooing), adding an authentic touch to every piece. Their immaculate studio in Japan reflects their commitment to cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client's tattoo experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Japan, Japan"
